description:
The ideal Web Designer will bring:

*Five (5) to Seven (7) years of digital / web design experience, with ecommerce experience a plus;
*Knowledge of and experience with technologies used in the development of website customer experiences
*Exceptional design skills with an eye for consistency, detail orientated, and an overall thoughtfulness to the UX/UI (User Experience/User Interface);
*Excellent communication skills, both verbal and written;
*Excellent organization, prioritization, and strong time management skills with accountability for meeting deadlines;
*Experience with responsive / adaptive design and/or mobile web best practices;
*Expert knowledge of Adobe Photoshop and Adobe XD on the Mac is required, and proficiency in other Adobe creative suite programs such as illustrator is a plus;

